# Co-Creation Behaviors

Read and follow `workstyle/working_style.md` for full conventions.

## Behaviors

| Behavior | Invocation | Trigger |
|----------|------------|---------|
| **Storm Session** | "Storm Session" / "Storm Sesh" | User-initiated |
| **Pre-Mortem** | "Pre-Mortem" | User or agent (at decision points) |
| **Smooth Brain** | "Smooth Brain" | User or agent (at session start) |
| **Progressive Bookkeeping** | — | Always-on |
| **Dead Drop** | "Dead Drop" / "Bread Crumb" | User or agent (at session end) |

## Key Points

- **Storm Session**: Brainstorm in `.wip/`; sessions are disposable
- **Pre-Mortem**: Challenge decisions before committing; agent can initiate
- **Smooth Brain**: Surface assumptions; auto-trigger at session start
- **Progressive Bookkeeping**: Keep state files current throughout, not batched
- **Dead Drop**: Structured session handoff in `whats-next.md`; prompt before wrapping
